commit f9581f4d3654b28b9d19c5717573a34a5e4ffdb4

C03: the Discord quick switcher is driven from the adapter again, as the earlier BAXY did (owner: typing «violeta» and pressing Enter by hand works, «the script only stopped at writing and never sent»): Escape, Ctrl+K, the name and Enter travel through the same SendInput path that already sends WhatsApp messages, with the waits the client needs (1.4 s after Ctrl+K, 1.2 s after typing); the PowerShell helper is gone because launching it stole the foreground, which closes the switcher, and its synthetic Enter never reached the row

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


